OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested in unsolved 1989
OL,4,Amurder probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith an unsolved murder that took place
OL,8,F37 years ago.
OL,10,FRichard Haywood, 36, known to many as
OL,11,FRicky, was shot multiple times in his
OL,12,Fflat above Ambiance Jewellers in
OL,13,FShirley Road, Southampton, on 16
OL,14,FOctober 1989.
OL,16,FDetectives reopened the murder
OL,17,Finvestigation in 2024. Earlier,
OL,18,FHampshire police officers carried out
OL,19,Fsearches and enquiries in Peach Road in
OL,20,Fthe city.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
